ww.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/rexford-industrial-realty-inc-rexr-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"REXR 2020 Q2","e":"rexr","d":"2020-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adeel Khan","x":"Given the impact of COVID-19 on our tenants and its impact to general market conditions, as well as local regulations along our tenants deferred rent, we're maintaining our guidance as follows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/rexford-industrial-realty-inc-rexr-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"REXR 2020 Q2","e":"rexr","d":"2020-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adeel Khan","x":"So yeah, we did reiterate the guidance, which was consistent with what we reported last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/rexford-industrial-realty-inc-rexr-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"REXR 2020 Q3","e":"rexr","d":"2020-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Frankel","x":"As a result, we are very pleased to be increasing our guidance, which Laura will be describing in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/rexford-industrial-realty-inc-rexr-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"REXR 2020 Q3","e":"rexr","d":"2020-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Clark","x":"…the added visibility we now have on collections, as well as the announced acquisition of San Fernando Road and the imminent closing of Gateway Pointe, we are increasing guidance for core FFO per share to $1.29 to $1.31 per share from our previous guidance range of $1.26 to $1.29 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/rexford-industrial-realty-inc-rexr-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"REXR 2021 Q3","e":"rexr","d":"2021-10-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Clark","x":"We have provided a roll forward detailing the drivers of our increased guidance in our supplemental package, a few highlights include, same property NOI growth on a GAAP basis has been increased to 8.25% to 8.75%, up 225 basis points at the midpoint and on a cash basis has been increased to 11.5%…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/rexford-industrial-realty-inc-rexr-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"REXR 2025 Q4","e":"rexr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mikayla Lynch","x":"Brendan Lynch: I think in the past, you've highlighted that your port exposure is somewhat limited, and that was kind of limiting some of the tariff risks over the past year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rexford-rexr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2025 Q4","e":"rexr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mikayla Lynch","x":"And do you see it as a potential catalyst if some of these tariffs are removed in the relatively near future?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rexford-rexr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2025 Q4","e":"rexr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Clark","x":"And as we look at net absorption today continues to be negative in the market and to see the inflection and really to see that pricing power shift to landlords, we need to be at a point where we're experiencing some continued quarters of positive absorption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rexford-rexr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2025 Q4","e":"rexr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Fitzmaurice","x":"For the full year, after adjusting for the co-CEO transition severance charges and other nonrecurring costs, core FFO per share was $2.40, placing us at the high end of our initial expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rexford-rexr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2025 Q4","e":"rexr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Fitzmaurice","x":"Note that co-CEO transition severance charges were fully recognized in the fourth quarter and will not impact 2026 results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rexford-rexr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2026 Q1","e":"rexr","d":"2026-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Nahas","x":"We saw the back half of 2025 show increased activity as compared to the first half of the year, where there was a bit more turmoil from tariffs and other macroeconomic impacts, and that produced some good volumes in the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/rexford-rexr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2026 Q1","e":"rexr","d":"2026-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Clark","x":"Finally, Fitz will walk through our financial results and increased full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/rexford-rexr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"REXR 2026 Q1","e":"rexr","d":"2026-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Clark","x":"Our first quarter results and increased full-year guidance expectations directly reflect our efforts to preserve cash flows and reduce capital costs, a continued focus moving forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/rexford-rexr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,6989,0,0,0,5767,874],[37,1,5719,0,0,0,4970,462],[38,1,6472,0,0,0,5526,646],[39,1,8870,0,0,0,7459,1044],[40,1,7905,0,0,0,6775,727],[41,1,8719,0,0,0,7589,768],[42,1,9409,0,0,0,7746,1222],[43,1,8295,0,0,0,6990,926],[44,1,7411,0,0,0,6196,888],[45,1,6994,0,0,0,5573,999],[46,1,7024,0,0,0,5453,1224],[47,1,9598,0,0,0,8165,1043],[64,1,6166,0,0,0,5923,0],[65,1,5961,0,0,0,4818,968],[67,1,6078,0,0,0,4809,836]],"cinema":[[36,1,6989,0,0,0,5767,874],[37,1,5719,0,0,0,4970,462],[38,1,6472,0,0,0,5526,646],[39,1,8870,0,0,0,7459,1044],[40,1,7905,0,0,0,6775,727],[41,1,8719,0,0,0,7589,768],[42,1,9409,0,0,0,7746,1222],[43,1,8295,0